    "description": "<p>UNLIVING-ZOMBIE</p>\n<p>Prerequisites Level 6</p>\n<p>Your body hangs with grave-heavy inertia, making you difficult to move once you plant yourself.</p>\n<p>Your corpse-body is difficult to shift. You gain a +2 racial bonus to checks and DCs against Shove, Trip, forced movement, and attempts to move you while grabbed or restrained.</p>\n<p>Works automatically: +2 racial to the Fortitude DC (and, for Trip, the Acrobatics DC) Shove, Trip and Reposition are rolled against. A save against forced movement offers +2 racial.</p>",
